      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Burlington and Missouri Railroad arrived in 1892, sparking Sheridan’s growth and the construction of the historic Sheridan Inn.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheridan%2C_Wyoming",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Tourism has long driven Sheridan’s economy, with visitors drawn to its western heritage and nearby mountain vistas.",
