      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sheridan%2C_Wyoming",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Sheridan hosts a vibrant rodeo scene that celebrates its ranching roots and caters to both locals and tourists.",
